/// Owner discriminator for the CLOSED allowlist of polymorphic tables:
/// AuditLog, ContentRevision, ContentDraft, MediaLink, FaqItem, PageSection,
/// SlugHistory, SearchDocument, OutboxEvent, SavedItem, AnalyticsEvent,
/// ContentDailyStat, AiGeneration, ContentEmbedding.
/// Adding a polymorphic owner to any OTHER model is an ESLint error.
